stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Login
    Login --> ViewDashboard
    ViewDashboard --> SelectPoster : Click "Evaluate Paper"
    SelectPoster --> OpenModal : Render Criteria Form
    OpenModal --> InputScores : Enter 0-10 for each criterion
    InputScores --> InputFeedback : Enter qualitative comments
    InputFeedback --> SubmitEvaluation
    SubmitEvaluation --> UpdateDatabase : Save Scores & Feedback
    UpdateDatabase --> CalculateTotal : Sum Criteria Scores
    CalculateTotal --> UpdatePosterStatus : Status = EVALUATED
    UpdatePosterStatus --> ViewDashboard : Return to Dashboard
    ViewDashboard --> [*]
